{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋個握わずー＼(^^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれた方、ほんとに\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帰りに雨ふってたけど、\nみんな大丈夫だったかなー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/30/3432529/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さてさて今日の私服だよー///\nあえて髪を結ばないひめたん(ω)\n秋だからねーこゆのもアリかなーて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんりぼん持ってったけど\n結局つかわんかったわそーいえば！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てへぺろ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/30/3432529/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全身写真よー∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度は途中まで\nちゃんと靴履いてたんだけど、\nやっぱり疲れてスリッパにしたー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だって疲れるんだもんー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もね、\nたくさんのひめきゅんさんとお話したの\n楽しかった＼(^^)／！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーさんとも写真撮ったから\nまたちょっとずつ貼ってくねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はわりと集合時間遅めだから\n今日はぐっすり寝るの(ω)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/30/3432529/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(＊´・ω・)ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}